795
00:59:21,390 --> 00:59:22,860
You were amazing, Soh!

796
00:59:22,930 --> 00:59:25,300
The way you made that comeback
was so cool.

797
00:59:25,480 --> 00:59:29,090
Thank you so much
for joining B.S. Brothers.

798
00:59:30,410 --> 00:59:31,700
Thank you very much.

799
00:59:34,070 --> 00:59:36,000
Told you plenty of people like you.

800
00:59:37,130 --> 00:59:38,220
You're amazing.

801
00:59:51,330 --> 00:59:52,160
You okay?

802
00:59:53,530 --> 00:59:54,130
Thanks.

803
00:59:55,100 --> 00:59:56,020
Yeah, no problem.

804
00:59:56,260 --> 00:59:57,930
